oke-readback.md`.\n\n## Sample IDs / Outcomes\n\n- `qrow_9709_m16_qp_12_q01`: pass; question read as `attemptable`, start/draft/submit events logged, posture fields reached attempt log and Copilot, visual dependency did not block text-only attemptability.\n- `qrow_9709_m16_qp_12_q02`: pass; question read as `attemptable`, start/draft/submit events logged, posture fields reached attempt log and Copilot, visual dependency did not block text-only attemptability.\n- `qrow_9709_m16_qp_12_q03`: pass; question read as `attemptable`, start/draft/submit events logged, posture fields reached attempt log and Copilot, visual dependency did not block text-only attemptability.\n\nCopilot wording for all samples is conservatively gated to: `I can log this attempt for review, but I cannot show a method diagnosis until evidence is available.`\n\n## No-Claim Boundaries\n\n- Local/dev smoke only.\n- No production HTTP probes.\n- No remote Supabase mutation or remote database mutation.\n- No storage upload.\n- No external VLM.\n- No UI change.\n- No launch-readiness, official scoring, rights approval, student-display-final, or Phase B2 readiness claim.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `env DATABASE_URL= SMOKE_DATABASE_URL= SUPABASE_URL= VITE_SUPABASE_URL= NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL= node scripts/smoke/full-beta-text-only-runtime-smoke.mjs --no-write` - pass, 3/3 samples.\n- `npm test -- --runInBand scripts/smoke/__tests__/full-beta-text-only-runtime-smoke.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/full-beta-text-first-attempt-flow.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/copilot-evidence-wording-gate.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/full-beta-visual-blocked-runtime.test.js` - pass, 4 suites / 34 tests.\n- `npx eslint scripts/smoke/full-beta-text-only-runtime-smoke.mjs scripts/smoke/__tests__/full-beta-text-only-runtime-smoke.test.js` - pass.\n- `git diff --check` - pass.\n- `git diff --cached --check` - pass before commit.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` - exit 0; worktree clean; report/artifact guard and A+ ratchet healthy; warnings only for branch naming convention and branch being one commit ahead of upstream.\n","created_at":"2026-07-03T15:02:46Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T15:13:11Z","closed_at":"2026-07-03T15:13:11Z","merged_at":"2026-07-03T15:13:11Z","merge_commit_sha":"026de9621990b401a442f76b93700ae7c9bd524c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1235/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1235/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1235/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/e990e718c02fb90c192b6066f493ab8a1bec7c8d","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1204","ref":"feat/issue-1204","sha":"e990e718c02fb90c192b6066f493ab8a1bec7c8d","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_typ